SECTION 3 — KubeVirt Control Plane
================================================================================

KCP-01 [C] virt-controller leader election flapping
  Signal : leader_election_master_status changes rapidly; virt-controller
           restart count exceeds threshold
  Playbook: Check etcd health and latency; inspect control-plane node
            resources; check API server connectivity

KCP-02 [B] virt-api unavailable
  Signal : up{job="virt-api"}==0
           (built-in: VirtAPIDown / KubeVirtComponentExceedsRequestedMemory)
  Playbook: Restart virt-api deployment; check webhook cert validity and
            expiry; verify service endpoints

KCP-03 [B] virt-handler not ready on node
  Signal : kube_daemonset_status_number_unavailable{daemonset="virt-handler"}>0
           (built-in: VirtHandlerDaemonSetRolloutFailing)
  Playbook: Cordon+drain node; check kubelet status; restart virt-handler;
            verify node labels match nodeSelector

KCP-04 [C] Webhook cert expiring
  Signal : Custom cert-expiry exporter:
           ssl_certificate_expiry_seconds{secret=~"kubevirt.*"} < 7d
  Playbook: Trigger cert-manager renewal or manual rotation job; test
            webhooks after rotation

KCP-05 [B] HyperConverged operator degraded
  Signal : kubevirt_hco_system_health_status != 0
           (built-in: KubevirtHyperconvergedClusterOperatorCRError)
  Playbook: Check HCO operator logs; inspect each component CR status;
            verify all CNV CSVs are Succeeded

