SECTION 4 — OpenShift Core / Kubernetes
================================================================================

OCP-01 [B] Node NotReady while hosting VMs
  Signal : kube_node_status_condition{condition="Ready",status="false"}
           (built-in: KubeNodeNotReady)
  Playbook: Trigger VM evacuation/live-migration playbook; cordon node;
            check kubelet; escalate to infra; fence node if hardware failure

OCP-02 [B] Node memory/CPU pressure
  Signal : kube_node_status_condition{condition="MemoryPressure"} or
           node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes < threshold
           (built-in: KubeMemoryOvercommit)
  Playbook: Cordon node; migrate VMs off; review overcommit ratio;
            alert infra team

OCP-03 [B] etcd high fsync latency
  Signal : etcd_disk_wal_fsync_duration_seconds_bucket p99 > 100ms
           (built-in: etcdHighFsyncDurations)
  Playbook: Check underlying disk IOPS; isolate etcd to dedicated disks;
            check etcd peer network; alert infra

OCP-04 [B] API server 5xx error rate high
  Signal : rate(apiserver_request_total{code=~"5.."}[5m]) /
           rate(apiserver_request_total[5m]) > 0.01
           (built-in: KubeAPIErrorBudgetBurn)
  Playbook: Check API server pod logs; check etcd connectivity; scale API
            server if load-driven; alert platform team

OCP-05 [C] HugePages exhaustion on VM nodes
  Signal : node_memory_HugePages_Free < threshold on nodes running VMs
  Playbook: Adjust HugePage pre-allocation; reschedule HugePages-requiring
            VMs; reboot node to reclaim

OCP-06 [B] Cluster certificate expiry
  Signal : apiserver_client_certificate_expiration_seconds p50 < 30d
           (built-in: KubeClientCertificateExpiration)
  Playbook: Trigger cert rotation job; verify all components re-bootstrap;
            test cluster access post-rotation

OCP-07 [B] OLM CSV install/upgrade failed
  Signal : csv_succeeded==0 for any operator CSV;
           also csv_abnormal event in Splunk
  Playbook: Check OLM operator pod logs; check subscription channel;
            force CSV delete and re-install if stuck

OCP-08 [E] Descheduler aggressively evicting VMI pods
  Signal : Rate of pod eviction events for virt-launcher pods via Splunk
           event stream
  Playbook: Add VMI pod anti-eviction annotation or descheduler exclusion
            policy; review LowNodeUtilization thresholds

