SECTION 5 — Networking (SR-IOV / Multus / OVN-Kubernetes)
================================================================================

NET-01 [C] SR-IOV VF pool exhausted
  Signal : sriov_device_plugin_available_vfs == 0 on a node
           (custom; SR-IOV device plugin exposes allocatable metric)
  Playbook: Reschedule VMs to nodes with free VFs; request NIC admin to
            increase VF count; check sriov-network-operator config

NET-02 [E] Multus NAD misconfiguration
  Signal : K8s Event reason=FailedCreatePodSandBox with Multus error
           pattern via Splunk
  Playbook: Validate NetworkAttachmentDefinition YAML; check OVN-Kubernetes
            plugin on node; verify IPAM ranges not exhausted

NET-03 [B] OVN-Kubernetes pod failure
  Signal : up{job="ovnkube-node"}==0 or
           kube_pod_status_ready{pod=~"ovnkube-.*"}==0
           (built-in: OVNKubernetesDown)
  Playbook: Restart ovnkube-node daemonset pod; check br-int bridge on node;
            verify OVS daemon health

NET-04 [E] Live migration blocked — target node missing secondary network
  Signal : Migration failure event correlated with target node missing
           required NetworkAttachmentDefinition label via Splunk
  Playbook: Fix node labeling; apply NAD to target node; verify Multus config
            on all migration-eligible nodes

