SECTION 8 — Dell CSM (Container Storage Modules)
================================================================================

CSM-01 [C] CSI driver node plugin not ready
  Signal : kube_pod_status_ready{pod=~"dell-csm-.*",container="driver"}==0
           or DaemonSet unavailable count > 0
  Playbook: Restart CSM node plugin pod; check iSCSI/FC initiator on node;
            verify array connectivity; check CSM operator logs

CSM-02 [C] Volume provisioning failure
  Signal : kube_persistentvolumeclaim_status_phase{phase="Pending"} for
           CSM StorageClass PVCs > 5m; CSM provisioner error events in Splunk
  Playbook: Check CSM controller pod logs; verify array credentials in secret;
            check quota on array; test array API reachability

CSM-03 [C] Array connectivity lost
  Signal : CSM controller pod error logs (array unreachable); custom:
           blackbox probe on array management IP
  Playbook: Check array management network; verify credentials not rotated;
            check CSM secret; escalate to Dell storage admin

CSM-04 [E] Volume snapshot stuck Creating
  Signal : volumesnapshot_ready_to_use==false duration > 10m;
           snapshotcontent errors in Splunk
  Playbook: Check CSM snapshotter pod logs; verify array snapshot quota;
            check VolumeSnapshotClass config; retry snapshot

CSM-05 [C] CSM replication RPO breach
  Signal : csm_replication_rpo_seconds > configured SLA threshold
           (CSM Replication module exposes this metric)
  Playbook: Alert DR team; check replication link bandwidth; check array
            replication logs; escalate if RPO breach confirmed

CSM-06 [C] iSCSI/FC multipath degraded
  Signal : Custom: node-level multipath checker (multipathd) exporting
           path count; path_count < expected_paths
  Playbook: Check HBA/NIC health on node; verify zoning/masking on fabric;
            restart multipathd; check array port availability

CSM-07 [C] CSM operator upgrade stuck
  Signal : csv_succeeded{name=~"dell-csm.*"}==0 > 15m;
           also OLM InstallPlan approval pending
  Playbook: Check CSM operator pod logs; approve InstallPlan if manual;
            verify CRD compatibility; rollback if needed

